@startuml
title Kernel Module Lifecycle — Simplified Success and Failure Paths
[*] --> Building
Building --> Compiled : make succeeds
Building --> Failed : build fails
Failed --> [*]
Compiled --> Loading : insmod
Loading --> Loaded : permitted, dependencies and init succeed
Loading --> Failed : load rejected / init fails
Loaded --> Unloading : rmmod permitted; module not busy
Loaded --> Loaded : unload rejected / references remain
Unloading --> [*]
@enduml
